# Root working artifacts: patches, commit messages and gate logs are session scratch,
# not repository content. They had accumulated to ~200 files, so the pre-commit hook
# warned about untracked files on every single commit — a warning that always fires is
# a warning nobody reads, which is the same rot the exemption register exists to stop.
# `_gate?.log` and `_g*.log` were already here; the rest is what the pile actually was.
*.patch
*.msg
_g*.log
_g*.out
gate*.log
gate*.txt
